# A Small Celebration
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
What are we celebrating?
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
We made it through another week.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
That is enough?
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
It should have been enough sooner.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
Then give me the crisp piece.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
There are no guests, no speeches, and more than enough reasons to set two places.
